tools/office-snapshot.mjs imports the REAL foreman engine
(mini-services/agent-hq/src/office.ts) and runs its own scripted sim
scenario (src/sim.ts) over the bundled demo-data/ books — no parallel
fake office, no LLM, no keys. Emits status/office.json (every value
measured; peak-frame rule + provenance recorded) and status/office.html
(self-contained RTL dark page, zero JS, zero external assets, DEMO ·
SIMULATION watermark, palette/naming from the UI's own law: globals.css
night palette + tokens.ts + i18n.ts).

.github/workflows/office-snapshot.yml: dispatch + cron '17 */3 * * *' +
push(main, paths-filtered) -> bun install -> bake -> Pages artifact
staged under _pages/status so the URL keeps /status/office.html ->
deploy-pages@v4. permissions pages:write/id-token:write/contents:read,
concurrency office-snapshot-pages. Public repo => free Actions minutes.
